License status of the original Compare These Texts source

No open-source license has been selected for the original project source.
This repository does not grant an additional license to copy, modify or
redistribute that source. Contact the repository owner to discuss permission.
The npm metadata therefore uses UNLICENSED, not the Unlicense.

Third-party libraries and fonts retain their own licenses. Their license and
source notices are included beside the corresponding files in src/. This
notice does not replace or restrict those third-party licenses.
